        "type": "base",
        "description": "<p>You can target yourself instead of one creature with this ability. Choose one of the following effects, which lasts until the end of the encounter or until you are dying:</p><ul><li><p>Whenever a target makes a power roll, they can roll three dice and choose which two rolls to use.<br>[[/apply ex9YrYItyz3tJ38A]]{Roll high on tests} &amp; [[/apply 8KJs69qTpATXEdF8]]{Roll high on abilities}</p></li><li><p>Whenever a target makes a power roll, they must roll three dice and use the lowest two rolls.<br>[[/apply Compendium.draw-steel.abilities.Item.tpEhMJt2yZATNnlo.ActiveEffect.rliZ9NXdk60QqjI0]]{Roll low on tests} &amp; [[/apply QrJNl411MJpTax3K]]{Roll low on abilities}</p></li></ul>",
